H1: Forex Manager API for Brokerage Technology
Every time someone on your team logs into the MT5 Manager terminal to create an account, adjust a balance or pull a report by hand, that's work a well-built integration could do automatically. Multiply that by hundreds of clients a week and the cost adds up quickly, both in hours and in mistakes.
