H2: Security and Control
An integration that can create accounts and change balances needs to be built carefully.
Access is limited to the permissions each integration actually needs, rather than full administrator rights. Credentials are stored securely. Every automated action is logged, so you can see what happened, when and why. Balance operations can be tied to approval workflows, so money doesn't move without the checks your finance team requires.
We'd always rather build an integration that's slightly slower to set up and properly controlled than one that's quick and risky.
